# New User Created Via Net.EXE With Never Expire Option | T1136.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_net_user_add_never_expire.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image IN ("*\\net.exe", "*\\net1.exe") OR OriginalFileName IN ("net.exe", "net1.exe")) CommandLine="*user*" CommandLine="*add*" CommandLine="*expires:never*"
